### Feature ServiceOrders — UPDATE y estado del proceso (JWT + RBAC)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
# access_token: POST /api/sesion/login (features/auth/session/http/session.http) o npm run dev:token -- admin
@token = pega-aqui-el-access-token

### PUT (fechas, notas, impuesto y descuento)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/ordenes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "received_at": "2026-11-20T08:00:00Z",
  "delivery_date": "2026-11-22T17:00:00Z",
  "notes": "Cliente pidió entrega urgente",
  "tax": 0,
  "discount": 5000
}

### PATCH (solo descuento)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/ordenes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "discount": 2000
}

### Avanzar estado: received → in_process
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/ordenes/1/estado
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "process_status": "in_process" }

### in_process → ready
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/ordenes/1/estado
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "process_status": "ready" }

### ready → delivered
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/ordenes/1/estado
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "process_status": "delivered" }

### Saltar o retroceder estados → 409
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/ordenes/1/estado
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "process_status": "received" }
